## SC-005: Printing Internal Documents

**Risk:** Medium–High

**Situation:** An employee copies sensitive financial information into an unapproved application or prints confidential documents.

| Element | Design |
|---|---|
| Channel | Endpoint |
| Detection | Restricted or Confidential label |
| Action | Block or audit based on classification |
| Override | Justification for selected Confidential activities |
| Investigation | Review application and printing activity |

**Suggested:** Controls should reflect data sensitivity and the destination risk. Blocking every clipboard action could disrupt legitimate business workflows.

